	"CommonPrayers/KONTAKION/MTTL6": {
		"text": "As thou art a well-spring of compassion, vouchsafe mercy unto us, O Theotokos.  Look upon a sinful people; show forth, as always, thy power.  For hoping in thee we cry “Rejoice!” to thee, as once did Gabriel, the Supreme Commander of the Bodiless Hosts.",
		"header": "Lenten Theotokion for Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday"
	},
