	"CommonPrayers/TROPARION/SUN1": {
		"text": "When the stone had been sealed by the Jews; while the soldiers were guarding Thy most pure Body; Thou didst rise on the third day, O Savior, granting life to the world. The powers of heaven therefore cried to Thee, O Giver of Life: Glory to Thy Resurrection, O Christ! Glory to Thy Kingdom! Glory to Thy dispensation, O Thou who lovest mankind.",
		"header": "Troparion in the First Tone"
	},
	"CommonPrayers/TROPARION/SUN2": {
		"text": "\r\nWhen Thou didst descend to death, O Life Immortal, Thou didst slay hell with the splendor of Thy Godhead! And when from the depths Thou didst raise the dead, all the powers of heaven cried out: O Giver of Life! Christ our God! Glory to Thee!",
		"header": "Troparion in the Second Tone"
	},
	"CommonPrayers/TROPARION/SUN3": {
		"text": "\r\nLet the heavens rejoice! Let the earth be glad! For the Lord has shown strength with His arm! He has trampled down death by death! He has become the first-born of the dead! He has delivered us from the depths of hell, and has granted the world great mercy!",
		"header": "Troparion in the Third Tone"
	},
	"CommonPrayers/TROPARION/SUN4": {
		"text": "\r\nWhen the women disciples of the Lord learned from the angel the joyous message of Thy resurrection; they cast away the ancestral curse and elatedly told the apostles: Death is overthrown! Christ God is risen, granting the world great mercy.",
		"header": "Troparion in the Fourth Tone"
	},
	"CommonPrayers/TROPARION/SUN5": {
		"text": "\r\nLet us, the faithful, praise and worship the Word, co-eternal with the Father and the Spirit, born for our salvation from the Virgin; for He willed to be lifted up on the Cross in the flesh, to endure death, and to raise the dead by His glorious Resurrection.",
		"header": "Troparion in the Fifth Tone"
	},
	"CommonPrayers/TROPARION/SUN6": {
		"text": "\r\nThe angelic powers were at Thy tomb; the guards became as dead men. Mary stood by Thy grave, seeking Thy most pure Body. Thou didst capture hell, not being tempted by it. Thou didst come to the Virgin, granting life. O Lord who didst rise from the dead: glory to Thee!",
		"header": "Troparion in the Sixth Tone"
	},
	"CommonPrayers/TROPARION/SUN7": {
		"text": "\r\nBy Thy Cross, Thou didst destroy death! To the thief, Thou didst open Paradise! For the myrrh bearers, Thou didst change weeping into joy! And Thou didst command Thy disciples, O Christ God, to proclaim that Thou art risen, granting the world great mercy!",
		"header": "Troparion in the Seventh Tone"
	},
	"CommonPrayers/TROPARION/SUN8": {
		"text": "\r\nThou didst descend from on high, O Merciful One! Thou didst accept the three-day burial to free us from our sufferings! O Lord, our Life and Resurrection: glory to Thee!",
		"header": "Troparion in the Eighth Tone"
	},
